"\n"
"[.description]\n"
"--\n"
"Sets the timeout duration for blocking mailer operations. When using the blocking mailer (`io.quarkus.mailer.Mailer` interface), this timeout determines how long to wait for the mail to be sent before throwing a `java.util.concurrent.TimeoutException`.\n"
"\n"
"This prevents indefinite thread blocking when SMTP servers are misconfigured or unreachable. A value of 0 means no timeout (wait indefinitely) - which is not recommended.\n"
"\n"
